{
  "board": "ESP32-WROOM-32 DevKit v1",
  "summary": "One non-blocking control loop at 50 Hz. An L298N drives two DC motors; an HC-SR04 provides forward distance; two IR modules provide side awareness; a status LED and a JSON telemetry line expose the internal state. The servo scan is compiled in but disabled by default.",
  "components": [
    {
